Acelata     :   Nuke for 260720 /chad/ Gamejam
Finished    :   20260729 (On TIME)
Gamejam     :  <https://game.chud.cyou/260720>

 Please Enjoy.

-- HOW TO PLAY --

 ./acelata.out <player-count {2}-4>

 WASD         + E
 IJKL         + O
 ARROW        + 0
 KEYPAD ARROW + +

-- ----------- --

 Instructions for compilation follow...

-- Desktop --

:::Some assembly required:::

git clone https://github.com/8e8m/acelata --depth=1
cd acelata
make run

 # ... inside acelata ...

 # Ensure libraylib.so.5.5/libglfw.so exists in your linker path.
 # If you do not or cannot install raylib via your package manager:

git clone https://github.com/raysan5/raylib --depth=1
sudo make -C raylib/src/ PLATFORM=PLATFORM_DESKTOP BUILD_MODE=RELEASE RAYLIB_LIBTYPE=SHARED install

 # Ensure libchad.so (https://github.com/BasedProject/libchad) exists in your linker path.
git clone https://github.com/BasedProject/libchad --depth=1
sudo make -C libchad install

